{"1520590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slap It Together!", "steam_appid": 1520590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap-It Together! is a silly, first-person slapper (yes, slapper) where you must fight off waves of enemies to escape a gameshow. <i>Plants vs Zombies</i> meets <i>Left 4 Dead</i> in this fun, physics sandbox. Play in singleplayer or with up to 4 friends in online co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e019b5d8762392e915f2518ee7bcd386.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e019b5d8762392e915f2518ee7bcd386.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e019b5d8762392e915f2518ee7bcd386.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your brain churning (the zombies love it!) and figure out the various brain-teasers to progress through the various levels at your disposal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/2682b88b180c5ddce1a36bd8ac3ab211.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/2682b88b180c5ddce1a36bd8ac3ab211.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/2682b88b180c5ddce1a36bd8ac3ab211.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE HORDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These brain-dead buffoons will stop at nothing to entertain the audience, even if it means making a fool out of you. <strong>Stop them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e30107605b6e0f62df7ed45c74b094ea.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e30107605b6e0f62df7ed45c74b094ea.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e30107605b6e0f62df7ed45c74b094ea.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE SHOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been kidnapped and forced to participate in this zany spectacle, but don't let that dampen your spirits!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Slap-It Games</i> are sure to make someone smile...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/a8f911d28011fc7323b2260a104d06d1.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/a8f911d28011fc7323b2260a104d06d1.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/a8f911d28011fc7323b2260a104d06d1.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you play along with Dr. Rio Rascal's maniacal game and hope for the best, or will you put your foot down and give the audience a show they'll never forget? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, but choose wisely, or you might end up as the punchline of the next joke.  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap-It Together! is a silly, first-person slapper (yes, slapper) where you must fight off waves of enemies to escape a gameshow. <i>Plants vs Zombies</i> meets <i>Left 4 Dead</i> in this fun, physics sandbox. Play in singleplayer or with up to 4 friends in online co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e019b5d8762392e915f2518ee7bcd386.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e019b5d8762392e915f2518ee7bcd386.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e019b5d8762392e915f2518ee7bcd386.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your brain churning (the zombies love it!) and figure out the various brain-teasers to progress through the various levels at your disposal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/2682b88b180c5ddce1a36bd8ac3ab211.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/2682b88b180c5ddce1a36bd8ac3ab211.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/2682b88b180c5ddce1a36bd8ac3ab211.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE HORDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These brain-dead buffoons will stop at nothing to entertain the audience, even if it means making a fool out of you. <strong>Stop them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e30107605b6e0f62df7ed45c74b094ea.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e30107605b6e0f62df7ed45c74b094ea.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/e30107605b6e0f62df7ed45c74b094ea.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE SHOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been kidnapped and forced to participate in this zany spectacle, but don't let that dampen your spirits!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Slap-It Games</i> are sure to make someone smile...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/a8f911d28011fc7323b2260a104d06d1.poster.avif?t=1738854234\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/a8f911d28011fc7323b2260a104d06d1.webm?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/extras/a8f911d28011fc7323b2260a104d06d1.mp4?t=1738854234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you play along with Dr. Rio Rascal's maniacal game and hope for the best, or will you put your foot down and give the audience a show they'll never forget? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, but choose wisely, or you might end up as the punchline of the next joke.  </p>", "short_description": "A whacky first-person physics sandbox where you fight off waves of zombies in an attempt to escape a gameshow. Play solo or join your friends with up to 4 players online.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/header.jpg?t=1738854234", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738854234", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738854234", "website": "https://www.headtiltgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 Processor (or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Should work on most low-end laptops</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 Processor (or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Netw